# TeiaCareVideoIO Changelog

## [0.2.2] - 2026-04-21
### Changed
- Migrate build toolchain to Conan 2 and venvpp2
- Point scripts submodule to TeiaCare/venvpp2
- CI: increase coverage job timeout (5m → 20m) and gate Codacy on file presence
- CI: disable tests in Build step and examples in Unit Tests step
- CI: let conancenter resolve recipes before teiacare remote
